<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Press & Media | REVIVO</title>
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
</head>
<body>
<%- include('../partials/user/header') %>

<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 md:py-16 lg:py-20">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-center mb-8 md:mb-12 text-[#2C2C2C]">Press & Media</h1>
    
    <div class="mb-12 md:mb-16">
      <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-[#f8f7f5] via-[#f8c78d]/20 to-[#f8f7f5] p-8 rounded-lg border-l-4 border-[#2C2C2C] mb-8 text-center">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
          <svg class="w-12 h-12 text-[#2C2C2C]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M19 20H5a2 2 0 01-2-2V6a2 2 0 012-2h10a2 2 0 012 2v1m2 13a2 2 0 01-2-2V7m2 13a2 2 0 002-2V9a2 2 0 00-2-2h-2m-4-3H9M7 16h6M7 8h6v4H7V8z"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4 text-[#2C2C2C]">REVIVO in the News</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          Discover our latest press coverage, media resources, and company announcements. We're proud to share our story and mission with the world.
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="bg-gray-50 p-8 rounded-lg shadow-sm">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4 text-[#2C2C2C]">Media Inquiries</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
          For press inquiries, interview requests, or high-resolution images, please contact our media relations team:
        </p>
        
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center gap-4 mb-6">
          <a href="mailto:press@revivo.com" class="bg-[#2C2C2C] text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-md hover:bg-black transition duration-300 text-center">press@revivo.com</a>
          <span class="text-gray-700">or</span>
          <a href="tel:+1-555-123-4567" class="border border-[#2C2C2C] text-[#2C2C2C] px-6 py-3 rounded-md hover:bg-gray-100 transition duration-300 text-center">+1 (555) 123-4567</a>
        </div>
        
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
          Our team typically responds to all media inquiries within 24-48 hours during business days.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="mb-12 md:mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-semibold mb-6 text-center text-[#2C2C2C]">Recent Press Coverage</h2>
      
      <div class="space-y-8">
        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border border-gray-100">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="w-16 h-16 flex-shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#f8c78d]/30 flex items-center justify-center">
              <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-[#2C2C2C]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M19 20H5a2 2 0 01-2-2V6a2 2 0 012-2h10a2 2 0 012 2v1m2 13a2 2 0 01-2-2V7m2 13a2 2 0 002-2V9a2 2 0 00-2-2h-2m-4-3H9M7 16h6M7 8h6v4H7V8z"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-[#2C2C2C] mb-2">"REVIVO Leads the Vintage Revival Movement"</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-600 mb-3">Fashion Weekly • June 2024</p>
              <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
                "With their thoughtful approach to merging heritage designs with modern sustainability practices, REVIVO is setting a new standard for conscious fashion that honors the past while looking to the future."
              </p>
              <a href="#" class="text-[#2C2C2C] font-medium hover:underline">Read Full Article →</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border border-gray-100">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="w-16 h-16 flex-shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#2C2C2C]/10 flex items-center justify-center">
              <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-[#2C2C2C]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M15.232 5.232l3.536 3.536m-2.036-5.036a2.5 2.5 0 113.536 3.536L6.5 21.036H3v-3.572L16.732 3.732z"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-[#2C2C2C] mb-2">"The Brands Redefining Vintage-Inspired Fashion"</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-600 mb-3">Style Today • April 2024</p>
              <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
                "REVIVO stands out in the crowded fashion landscape by creating pieces that feel simultaneously nostalgic and fresh. Their Prime Layers collection demonstrates how vintage silhouettes can be reimagined for the modern wardrobe."
              </p>
              <a href="#" class="text-[#2C2C2C] font-medium hover:underline">Read Full Article →</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border border-gray-100">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="w-16 h-16 flex-shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#f8c78d]/30 flex items-center justify-center">
              <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-[#2C2C2C]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M3.055 11H5a2 2 0 012 2v1a2 2 0 002 2 2 2 0 012 2v2.945M8 3.935V5.5A2.5 2.5 0 0010.5 8h.5a2 2 0 012 2 2 2 0 104 0 2 2 0 012-2h1.064M15 20.488V18a2 2 0 012-2h3.064M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-[#2C2C2C] mb-2">"Sustainability Meets Style: Brands Making a Difference"</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-600 mb-3">Sustainable Business • March 2024</p>
              <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
                "By prioritizing ethical production and sustainable materials without compromising on design, REVIVO demonstrates that fashion can be both beautiful and responsible."
              </p>
              <a href="#" class="text-[#2C2C2C] font-medium hover:underline">Read Full Article →</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="mb-12 md:mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-6 text-center text-[#2C2C2C]">Press Releases</h2>
      
      <div class="space-y-6">
        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border border-gray-100">
          <div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-3">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-[#2C2C2C]">REVIVO Launches Y2K Essentials Collection</h3>
            <span class="text-gray-600 text-sm">May 15, 2024</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
            REVIVO is excited to announce the launch of our newest collection, Y2K Essentials, featuring modern interpretations of early 2000s fashion with sustainable materials and improved construction.
          </p>
          <a href="#" class="text-[#2C2C2C] font-medium hover:underline">Read Full Release →</a>
        </div>
        
        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border border-gray-100">
          <div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-3">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-[#2C2C2C]">REVIVO Announces Sustainability Commitments for 2025</h3>
            <span class="text-gray-600 text-sm">February 22, 2024</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
            Today, REVIVO unveiled its comprehensive sustainability roadmap for the next three years, including commitments to carbon neutrality, fully traceable supply chains, and expanded repair services.
          </p>
          <a href="#" class="text-[#2C2C2C] font-medium hover:underline">Read Full Release →</a>
        </div>
        
        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border border-gray-100">
          <div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-3">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-[#2C2C2C]">REVIVO Partners with Textile Innovation Lab</h3>
            <span class="text-gray-600 text-sm">November 10, 2023</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
            REVIVO is proud to announce a new partnership with the Textile Innovation Lab to develop next-generation sustainable fabrics that combine vintage aesthetics with cutting-edge eco-friendly technology.
          </p>
          <a href="#" class="text-[#2C2C2C] font-medium hover:underline">Read Full Release →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="mt-8 text-center">
        <a href="#" class="text-[#2C2C2C] font-medium hover:underline">View All Press Releases →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="mb-12 md:mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-6 text-center text-[#2C2C2C]">Media Resources</h2>
      
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border border-gray-100">
          <svg class="w-10 h-10 text-[#2C2C2C] mb-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M4 16l4.586-4.586a2 2 0 012.828 0L16 16m-2-2l1.586-1.586a2 2 0 012.828 0L20 14m-6-6h.01M6 20h12a2 2 0 002-2V6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2z"></path>
          </svg>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-medium mb-2 text-[#2C2C2C]">Brand Assets</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
            Download our logo, brand guidelines, and approved imagery for media use.
          </p>
          <a href="#" class="text-[#2C2C2C] font-medium hover:underline">Access Brand Kit →</a>
        </div>
        
        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border border-gray-100">
          <svg class="w-10 h-10 text-[#2C2C2C] mb-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M19 11H5m14 0a2 2 0 012 2v6a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2v-6a2 2 0 012-2m14 0V9a2 2 0 00-2-2M5 11V9a2 2 0 012-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h6a2 2 0 012 2v2M7 7h10"></path>
          </svg>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-medium mb-2 text-[#2C2C2C]">Product Images</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
            High-resolution product photography from our current collections.
          </p>
          <a href="#" class="text-[#2C2C2C] font-medium hover:underline">Browse Image Library →</a>
        </div>
        
        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border border-gray-100">
          <svg class="w-10 h-10 text-[#2C2C2C] mb-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M15 10l4.553-2.276A1 1 0 0121 8.618v6.764a1 1 0 01-1.447.894L15 14M5 18h8a2 2 0 002-2V8a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v8a2 2 0 002 2z"></path>
          </svg>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-medium mb-2 text-[#2C2C2C]">Video Content</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
            Campaign videos, behind-the-scenes footage, and interviews with our team.
          </p>
          <a href="#" class="text-[#2C2C2C] font-medium hover:underline">View Video Gallery →</a>
        </div>
        
        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border border-gray-100">
          <svg class="w-10 h-10 text-[#2C2C2C] mb-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M9 12h6m-6 4h6m2 5H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z"></path>
          </svg>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-medium mb-2 text-[#2C2C2C]">Fact Sheet</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
            Key information about REVIVO, including our history, mission, and sustainability initiatives.
          </p>
          <a href="#" class="text-[#2C2C2C] font-medium hover:underline">Download Fact Sheet →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="text-center">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-6 text-[#2C2C2C]">Connect With Us</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-8 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        Follow REVIVO on social media for the latest updates, behind-the-scenes content, and announcements.
      </p>
      
      <div class="flex justify-center gap-6 mb-8">
        <a href="#" class="text-[#2C2C2C] hover:text-black transition duration-300">
          <svg class="w-8 h-8" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path d="M12 2.163c3.204 0 3.584.012 4.85.07 3.252.148 4.771 1.691 4.919 4.919.058 1.265.069 1.645.069 4.849 0 3.205-.012 3.584-.069 4.849-.149 3.225-1.664 4.771-4.919 4.919-1.266.058-1.644.07-4.85.07-3.204 0-3.584-.012-4.849-.07-3.26-.149-4.771-1.699-4.919-4.92-.058-1.265-.07-1.644-.07-4.849 0-3.204.013-3.583.07-4.849.149-3.227 1.664-4.771 4.919-4.919 1.266-.057 1.645-.069 4.849-.069zm0-2.163c-3.259 0-3.667.014-4.947.072-4.358.2-6.78 2.618-6.98 6.98-.059 1.281-.073 1.689-.073 4.948 0 3.259.014 3.668.072 4.948.2 4.358 2.618 6.78 6.98 6.98 1.281.058 1.689.072 4.948.072 3.259 0 3.668-.014 4.948-.072 4.354-.2 6.782-2.618 6.979-6.98.059-1.28.073-1.689.073-4.948 0-3.259-.014-3.667-.072-4.947-.196-4.354-2.617-6.78-6.979-6.98-1.281-.059-1.69-.073-4.949-.073zm0 5.838c-3.403 0-6.162 2.759-6.162 6.162s2.759 6.163 6.162 6.163 6.162-2.759 6.162-6.163c0-3.403-2.759-6.162-6.162-6.162zm0 10.162c-2.209 0-4-1.79-4-4 0-2.209 1.791-4 4-4s4 1.791 4 4c0 2.21-1.791 4-4 4zm6.406-11.845c-.796 0-1.441.645-1.441 1.44s.645 1.44 1.441 1.44c.795 0 1.439-.645 1.439-1.44s-.644-1.44-1.439-1.44z"/>
          </svg>
        </a>
        <a href="#" class="text-[#2C2C2C] hover:text-black transition duration-300">
          <svg class="w-8 h-8" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path d="M22.46 6c-.77.35-1.6.58-2.46.69.88-.53 1.56-1.37 1.88-2.38-.83.5-1.75.85-2.72 1.05C18.37 4.5 17.26 4 16 4c-2.35 0-4.27 1.92-4.27 4.29 0 .34.04.67.11.98C8.28 9.09 5.11 7.38 3 4.79c-.37.63-.58 1.37-.58 2.15 0 1.49.75 2.81 1.91 3.56-.71 0-1.37-.2-1.95-.5v.03c0 2.08 1.48 3.82 3.44 4.21a4.22 4.22 0 0 1-1.93.07 4.28 4.28 0 0 0 4 2.98 8.521 8.521 0 0 1-5.33 1.84c-.34 0-.68-.02-1.02-.06C3.44 20.29 5.7 21 8.12 21 16 21 20.33 14.46 20.33 8.79c0-.19 0-.37-.01-.56.84-.6 1.56-1.36 2.14-2.23z"/>
          </svg>
        </a>
        <a href="#" class="text-[#2C2C2C] hover:text-black transition duration-300">
          <svg class="w-8 h-8" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path d="M19 3H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v14a2 2 0 002 2h14a2 2 0 002-2V5a2 2 0 00-2-2zm-4.5 14.5h-3v-5.5h-2v-2h2v-1.5c0-1.93 1.07-3 3-3h2v2h-1c-.55 0-1 .45-1 1v1.5h2l-.5 2h-1.5v5.5z"/>
          </svg>
        </a>
        <a href="#" class="text-[#2C2C2C] hover:text-black transition duration-300">
          <svg class="w-8 h-8" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path d="M19.615 3.184c-3.604-.246-11.631-.245-15.23 0C.488 3.45.029 5.804 0 12c.029 6.185.484 8.549 4.385 8.816 3.6.245 11.626.246 15.23 0C23.512 20.55 23.971 18.196 24 12c-.029-6.185-.484-8.549-4.385-8.816zM9 16V8l8 3.993L9 16z"/>
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>
      
      <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
        <a href="/contact" class="bg-[#2C2C2C] text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-md hover:bg-black transition duration-300">Contact Press Team</a>
        <a href="/about" class="border border-[#2C2C2C] text-[#2C2C2C] px-6 py-3 rounded-md hover:bg-gray-100 transition duration-300">Learn About REVIVO</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<%- include('../partials/user/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
